% Three-verbs diagram page — what the prophet accuses in chapter 1, what comes back in chapter 3
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.5cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterRust} 三個動詞，兩個地方}\\[0.1cm]
{\normalsize Three Verbs, Two Places}

\vspace{0.6cm}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \node[font=\small\bfseries,text=ChapterRust] at (-3.4,4.4) {1:2-3 \ 先知的控告};
  \node[font=\small\bfseries,text=ChapterRust] at (3.4,4.4) {第3章 \ 三個動詞回來};

  \node[draw=ChapterRust,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=5.2cm,minimum height=1.3cm,font=\small,align=center] (a1) at (-3.4,3.3) {你不應允 \ \textit{You do not hear}\\ שָׁמַע \ 1:2};
  \node[draw=ScriptureGold,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=5.2cm,minimum height=1.3cm,font=\small,align=center] (b1) at (3.4,3.3) {我聽見了 \ \textit{I have heard}\\ 3:2、3:16};
  \draw[->,color=ScriptureGold,thick] (a1) -- (b1);

  \node[draw=ChapterRust,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=5.2cm,minimum height=1.3cm,font=\small,align=center] (a2) at (-3.4,1.6) {你還不拯救 \ \textit{You do not save}\\ יָשַׁע \ 1:2};
  \node[draw=ScriptureGold,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=5.2cm,minimum height=1.3cm,font=\small,align=center] (b2) at (3.4,1.6) {拯救 \ \textit{salvation} \ ×4\\ 3:8、3:13（2）、3:18};
  \draw[->,color=ScriptureGold,thick] (a2) -- (b2);

  \node[draw=ChapterRust,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=5.2cm,minimum height=1.3cm,font=\small,align=center] (a3) at (-3.4,-0.1) {你為何使我看見 \ \textit{Why make me see}\\ רָאָה \ 1:3};
  \node[draw=ScriptureGold,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=5.2cm,minimum height=1.3cm,font=\small,align=center] (b3) at (3.4,-0.1) {我見 \ \textit{I saw}\\ 3:7（3:6 神觀看；3:10 山嶺見你）};
  \draw[->,color=ScriptureGold,thick] (a3) -- (b3);

  \node[draw=ChapterRust,fill=white,rounded corners,minimum width=9.6cm,minimum height=0.9cm,font=\small\bfseries,text=ChapterRust,align=center] at (0,-1.9) {3:18 \ 然而，我要因耶和華歡欣 \ \textit{Yet I will exult in the LORD}};
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.8cm}

\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
先知在第一章向神提出三項控告：不聽、不救、使我看見。第三章，三個動詞全部回來：先知聽見了，拯救四次出現，先知也看見了。問題沒有被解釋掉；先知被帶到另一個地方站著。書的最後一個轉折，是「然而」。
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.5cm}
{\footnotesize\color{LightGray} 「然而，我要因耶和華歡欣，因救我的神喜樂。」— 哈巴谷書 3:18}
